
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Food Ordering Website</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #fff5e6;
            text-align: center;
        }

        header {
            background-color: orangered;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: yellow;
        }

        .offer {
            background-color: orange;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: orangered;
        }

        .menu {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            width: 220px;
            margin: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px gray;
            transition: 0.5s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .card img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 140px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        button {
            background-color: orangered;
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: green;
        }

        section {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: orangered;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
        }

        @media(max-width: 600px) {
            nav a {
                display: block;
                margin: 10px;
            }

            .card {
                width: 85%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>Foodie's Restaurant</h1>
    <p>Delicious Food at Your Doorstep</p>

    <nav>
        <a href="index.html">Home</a>
        <a href="index.html">Menu</a>
        <a href="index.html">Offers</a>
        <a href="index.html">Reviews</a>
        <a href="index.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>Restaurant Details</h2>
    <p>Welcome to Foodie's Restaurant</p>
    <p>Location: Vijayawada</p>
    <p>Rating: ⭐ 4.5/5</p>
    <p>Opening Hours: 10 AM - 10 PM</p>
</section>

<div class="offer">
    <h2>Special Offers</h2>
    <p>Get 20% OFF on your first order!</p>
    <p>Free Delivery on orders above ₹499</p>
</div>

<section>
    <h2>Our Food Menu</h2>

    <div class="menu">

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1568901346375-23c9450c58cd?w=400" alt="Burger">
            <h3>Burger</h3>
            <p>Price: ₹120</p>
            <button>Order Now</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571091718767-18b5b1457add?w=400" alt="Pizza">
            <h3>Pizza</h3>
            <p>Price: ₹250</p>
            <button>Order Now</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1513104890138-7c749659a591?w=400" alt="Pizza">
            <h3>Cheese Pizza</h3>
            <p>Price: ₹300</p>
            <button>Order Now</button>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1604908176997-125f25cc6f3d?w=400" alt="Biryani">
            <h3>Chicken Biryani</h3>
            <p>Price: ₹180</p>
            <button>Order Now</button>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Menu Categories</h2>
    <p>Starters | Main Course | Fast Food | Desserts | Drinks</p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Customer Reviews</h2>
    <p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Excellent food and service!</p>
    <p>⭐⭐⭐⭐ Very tasty and fresh food.</p>
    <p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ Good quality and fast delivery.</p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>Email: foodies@gmail.com</p>
    <p>Phone: 9876543210</p>
    <p>Address: Vijayawada, Andhra Pradesh</p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>Copyright 2026 Foodie's Restaurant</p>
    <p>Thank You! Visit Again.</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
